{
  "name": "quantset",
  "version": "0.1.3",
  "description": "QuantSet (https://quantset.dev) — Institutional market data API for AI trading platforms, AI hedge funds, Next.js market terminals & financial agents: 90,000+ global stocks (67 countries, 64yr history), reconciled SEC EDGAR XBRL financials (10-K, 10-Q, 13F, Form 4), 4,899 ETF look-throughs, Wall Street consensus estimates, 40-factor screener, crypto, FX & macro curves.",
